1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:09,344
Speaking, task one. Topic 12: Sport. Ten questions. Listen to the question and answer out loud.

2
00:00:10,033 --> 00:00:11,130
Do you do any sport?

3
00:00:16,533 --> 00:00:20,927
Yes, I do sport twice a week, I go running and swimming.

4
00:00:21,833 --> 00:00:23,461
What's your favourite sport?

5
00:00:28,867 --> 00:00:31,651
I like football best, I play it with my son too.

6
00:00:32,567 --> 00:00:33,872
Where do you do sport?

7
00:00:39,267 --> 00:00:41,666
I run in the park and swim in the town pool.

8
00:00:42,567 --> 00:00:44,411
Do you watch sport on TV?

9
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:52,462
Yes, I watch football, and ice hockey in winter.

10
00:00:53,367 --> 00:00:55,576
What sport is popular in your country?

11
00:01:00,967 --> 00:01:03,646
In my country football and boxing are the most popular.

12
00:01:04,533 --> 00:01:06,400
What sport did you do at school?

13
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:14,400
At school I played volleyball and ran.

14
00:01:15,300 --> 00:01:17,207
When did you last do sport?

15
00:01:22,600 --> 00:01:26,291
Yesterday, I swam for half an hour.

16
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:28,736
Why is sport important?

17
00:01:34,133 --> 00:01:37,758
Sport is important because it keeps us healthy and in a good mood.

18
00:01:38,667 --> 00:01:40,341
Will you do sport at the weekend?

19
00:01:45,733 --> 00:01:48,250
Yes, on Saturday I'll play football with colleagues.

20
00:01:49,133 --> 00:01:51,097
What sport would you like to try?

21
00:01:56,500 --> 00:01:59,516
I'd like to try tennis because it looks fun.

22
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:10,693
Great! Practise topic 12 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
